# The build context is the repo root, so that the Dockerfile can COPY the
# three clixon checkouts. Everything else stays out of it.
#
# snc-services is bind-mounted at run time, never built in. fetched/ is
# bind-mounted too.
venv/
fetched/
checkouts/snc-services/
.vscode/
harness/
docs/
**/.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
